{{Quote|Kessel, Fondor, targeting consoles from Jakku, proton warheads from Base Cay, the Steergard Starpath.|Attendant Heert, to Supervisor Dedra Meero|<ref name="The Axe Forgets">{{Andor|The Axe Forgets}}</ref>}}
'''Base Cay''' was a location.<ref name="The Axe Forgets" /> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">"[[The Axe Forgets]]" takes place between "[[Kassa (episode)|Kassa]]," which dates itself to [[5 BBY]], and "[[Narkina 5 (episode)|Narkina 5]]," which {{SW|url=andor-s1-e8-trivia-gallery|text="Narkina 5" Trivia Gallery &#124; Andor}} {{C|Slide 6}} dates to 5 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|BBY]].</ref> rebel activity involving Base Cay and its [[proton warhead]]s was recounted by [[Imperial Security Bureau]] [[ISB Attendant|Attendant]] [[Avril Heert]] as<ref name="The Axe Forgets" /> he<ref name="Comprehensive">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> and [[ISB Supervisor]] [[Dedra Meero]] reviewed files on recent rebel actions. When coupled with incidents at<ref name="The Axe Forgets" /> the [[planet]]s<ref name="Comprehensive" /><ref name="Fondor">{{Databank|fondor|Fondor}}</ref> [[Kessel]], [[Jakku]], [[Fondor]], and<ref name="The Axe Forgets" /> the astronomical object<ref name="One Year Later">{{Andor|One Year Later}}</ref> [[Steergard]], Meero felt the actions were spread out in a way that would indicate an organized rebel movement attempting to avoid detection. Heert agreed, stating the locations were "too random to be random."<ref name="The Axe Forgets" />

==Behind the scenes==
Base Cay was mentioned in "[[The Axe Forgets]],"<ref name="The Axe Forgets" /> the fifth episode of the [[Andor Season 1|first season]] of the live-action [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'', which aired on [[October 5]], [[2022]].<ref name="Release dates">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1557442379975573504|[[Star Wars]]|date=2022-8-10|quote=This is what revolution looks like. Watch #Andor, a Star Wars Original Series, streaming only on @DisneyPlus September 21.|archivedate=20220810191942}}</ref> Following the release of<ref name="Appendix">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}}</ref> the [[June 24]], [[2025]]<ref name="Substack">{{Substack|subdomain=jasonfry|url=p/about-that-new-star-wars-galaxy-map|text=About That New Star Wars Galaxy Map&hellip;|name=[[Jason Fry]]|username=jasonfry|date=2025-06-24}}</ref> "[[Star Systems of the Galaxy]]" appendix published with [[Star Wars Galaxy Map|''Star Wars'' Galaxy Map]] on [[StarWars.com]],<ref name="Appendix" /> author [[Jason Fry]] stated that Base Cay had not been included in the work due to it being a nickname<ref name="Jason Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-07-09-2.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-07-09}}</ref> or codename.<ref name="Substack">{{Substack|subdomain=jasonfry|url=p/about-that-new-star-wars-galaxy-map|text=About That New Star Wars Galaxy Map&hellip;|name=[[Jason Fry]]|username=jasonfry|date=2025-06-24}}</ref>

